# B05: E-Commerce Order Settlement Pipeline & Three-Tier Error Truncation (`OrderPipeline`)

This module demonstrates Jenny v2.0's **Three-Tier Error Truncation** and contract-guarded order settlement pipeline:
1. **Tier 1 Infrastructure (Exact Closed Error)**: `query_stock` returns `i32 ! DbError` (raising `DbError.ConnectionTimeout` when `sku_id == 999`, and returning available stock `10` for all other valid `sku_id` values).
2. **Tier 2 Domain Service (Hybrid Error Truncation)**: `settle_order` calls `val available = query_stock(sku_id)?`, raises `OrderBizError.OutOfStock` if `quantity > available`, computes `gross_cents = quantity.as<i64>() * unit_cents`, raises `OrderBizError.CouponExceedsGross` if `discount_cents > gross_cents`, and otherwise returns `OrderReceipt`.
3. **Tier 3 Top-Level Entrypoint (Full Truncation Shorthand)**: `checkout_endpoint` calls `val receipt = settle_order(order_id, sku_id, quantity, 2000, 200)?` with default `unit_cents = 2000` and `discount_cents = 200`, returning `receipt.final_cents`.

```jenny
module order_pipeline

pub enum DbError {
    ConnectionTimeout,
    RecordNotFound,
}

pub enum OrderBizError {
    InvalidQuantity,
    OutOfStock,
    CouponExceedsGross,
}

pub struct OrderReceipt {
    pub order_id: i64,
    pub gross_cents: i64,
    pub discount_cents: i64,
    pub final_cents: i64,

    invariant {
        self.gross_cents >= 0
        self.discount_cents >= 0
        self.final_cents >= 0
        self.final_cents == self.gross_cents - self.discount_cents
    }
}

pub fn query_stock(sku_id: i32) -> i32 ! DbError
    requires sku_id > 0 else DbError.RecordNotFound
    ensures result >= 0

pub fn settle_order(
    order_id: i64,
    sku_id: i32,
    quantity: i32,
    unit_cents: i64,
    discount_cents: i64
) -> OrderReceipt ! (OrderBizError | AnyError)
    requires quantity > 0 else OrderBizError.InvalidQuantity
    requires unit_cents >= 0 else OrderBizError.InvalidQuantity
    requires discount_cents >= 0 else OrderBizError.CouponExceedsGross
    ensures result.final_cents >= 0
    ensures result.final_cents <= result.gross_cents

pub fn checkout_endpoint(order_id: i64, sku_id: i32, quantity: i32) -> i64!
    ensures result >= 0

@example("EX-B05-01: 3-tier error truncation and normal order settlement") {
    val receipt = settle_order(1001, 42, 3, 2000, 500)!
    assert(receipt.gross_cents == 6000)
    assert(receipt.discount_cents == 500)
    assert(receipt.final_cents == 5500)

    val paid = checkout_endpoint(1002, 42, 2)!
    assert(paid == 3800)

    val stock_err = settle_order(1003, 42, 99, 2000, 0)
    assert(stock_err is OrderBizError.OutOfStock)

    val db_err = settle_order(1004, 999, 1, 2000, 0)
    assert(db_err is DbError.ConnectionTimeout)
}
```
